# Project A Login Sequence
* Client [Unity Client] -> Server [C++ IOCP Server] : CS_LOGIN (networkmanger::update)
* Server -> Client : SC_LOGIN_OK (PacketHandler)
* Client -> Server : CS_ENTER_GAME (GameScene::Init)
* Server -> Client : SC_ENTER_GAME (Room::Enter)
* Client -> Server : CS_GAME_READY
* Server -> Client : SC_PLAYER_SPAWN (Spawn Self / Monster Spawn)
* Server -> OtherClients [Other Unity Clients] : SC_PLAYER_SPAWN (Spawn Broadcast)
